---
---

<section id="runs-in" class="runs-in-wrap">
  <p class="section-label">DevCell starts and controls</p>
  <h2>One CLI. Three environments.</h2>
  <div class="runs-in-grid">
    <div class="env-card">
      <img src="/logos/linux.png" alt="Linux" class="env-icon" />
      <h3>Linux</h3>
      <p>Docker container. Zero config. Starts in seconds.</p>
      <code>devcell claude</code>
    </div>
    <div class="env-card">
      <img src="/logos/apple.png" alt="macOS" class="env-icon" />
      <h3>macOS</h3>
      <p>Tart VM. Full macOS guest.</p>
      <code>devcell claude --os macos</code>
    </div>
    <div class="env-card">
      <img src="/logos/windows.png" alt="Windows" class="env-icon" />
      <h3>Windows</h3>
      <p>QEMU Windows VM with WSL inside.</p>
      <code>devcell claude --os windows</code>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="runs-in-note">Same commands, same config, same toolchain. DevCell provisions the environment, mounts your project, and launches the agent. Pick the guest with <code>--os</code>.</p>
</section>

<style>
  .runs-in-wrap {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
  }

  .runs-in-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    border: var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .runs-in-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .env-card {
    padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
    border-right: var(--border);
    background: var(--white);
    text-align: center;
    transition: background 0.12s;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .env-card:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .env-card:hover { background: var(--accent); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .env-card { border-right: none; border-bottom: var(--border); }
    .env-card:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  }

  .env-icon {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .env-card h3 {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .env-card p {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .env-card code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    background: #0D0D0D;
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .runs-in-note {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #888;
  }

  .runs-in-note code {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
